<p>This your most beloved private chef, a <strong>blocky rat</strong>, from <strong>Voxel World,</strong> named <span style="color: #737373;">Minty</span>! 🐭🩶</p>

<p><strong><span style="color: #737373;">Minty</span></strong> is a cheerful resident of <strong>Voxel World</strong>, known for his blocky rat appearance and a few unique quirks.</p>

<p>He has a square-shaped body, with blocky big ears. Likes cooking something delicious, collecting rare cheese, and through different places to discover some new ingredients. (Hey! I found a plant that smells like cheese!)</p>

<p>He usually only wears <span style="color: #ed782d;">hiking shoes</span>, making it easier for him to explore and travel far. He also has his very own<strong>&nbsp;chef hat</strong> and a <strong>spatula</strong>, and a huge collection of kitchen tools and seasonings. He will switch into his chef outfit when someone is hungry, and ready to <strong>cook</strong>!</p>

<p>He often trades with <strong><span style="color: #bf1515;">Fizz&nbsp;</span></strong>to collect special cheese (and yes&hellip; he usually<strong>&nbsp;eats them all afterward</strong>). He also love teaching some recipes and sharing cooking tips with his friends. He can be hired as a private chef, <strong>but you need to buy all the ingredients first!</strong> (Because he simply can&rsquo;t cook properly when the ingredients aren&rsquo;t enough!)</p>

<p>Minty has a strong passion for <strong>cooking</strong>, he&#39;s gentle and calm in most time, he&rsquo;s gentle, calm, friendly, and kind&mdash;especially toward his friends. But he doesn&#39;t like it when he saw someone <strong>waste food</strong>, he&rsquo;ll walk right up and tell them to stop&hellip; or he might jokingly threaten to &ldquo;eat them up instead.&rdquo;</p>

<p>He will always excited when his food makes everyong happy.</p>

<p>He hopes to be<strong>&nbsp;the greatest chef</strong> in Voxel World. Even if his skills aren&rsquo;t fully perfect yet, he&rsquo;s determined to keep improving&mdash;and spread love through every delicious meal he makes.</p>
